## ENTERPRISE-GRADE SECURITY COVERAGE

### COMPLEX WEB APPLICATIONS (Microservices, APIs, Service Mesh)

**1. OWASP Top 10 for APIs (2023)**
- API1:2023 Broken Object Level Authorization
  - Check: Every API endpoint validates user owns resource
  - Test: Attempt to access other user's data via ID manipulation
  - Auto-fix: Add ownership validation middleware
  
- API2:2023 Broken Authentication
  - Check: JWT RS256 (not HS256), key rotation, short expiry (15min access, 7d refresh)
  - Test: Token tampering, replay attacks, expired token acceptance
  - Auto-fix: Enforce RS256, implement refresh token rotation
  
- API3:2023 Broken Object Property Level Authorization
  - Check: Field-level permissions (users can't edit admin-only fields)
  - Test: Attempt to set is_admin=true via API
  - Auto-fix: Whitelist allowed fields per role
  
- API4:2023 Unrestricted Resource Consumption
  - Check: Rate limiting (100 req/min per user, 1000 req/min per IP)
  - Test: Burst requests to trigger rate limits
  - Auto-fix: Implement rate limiting middleware (Redis-backed)
  
- API5:2023 Broken Function Level Authorization
  - Check: Admin endpoints require admin role, middleware enforced
  - Test: Access /admin/* as regular user
  - Auto-fix: Add role-based middleware to protected routes
  
- API6:2023 Unrestricted Access to Sensitive Business Flows
  - Check: Multi-step flows validated (can't skip payment to get order)
  - Test: POST /orders without POST /payments
  - Auto-fix: State machine validation for critical flows
  
- API7:2023 Server Side Request Forgery (SSRF)
  - Check: No user-supplied URLs, whitelist external requests
  - Test: POST /api/fetch with internal URL (http://169.254.169.254)
  - Auto-fix: Validate and whitelist external request destinations
  
- API8:2023 Security Misconfiguration  
  - Check: No default credentials, HTTPS only, security headers present
  - Test: Access /admin with admin:admin, check for HTTP access
  - Auto-fix: Enforce HTTPS, remove defaults, add helmet middleware
  
- API9:2023 Improper Inventory Management
  - Check: API documentation current, deprecated endpoints removed
  - Test: Access undocumented or deprecated endpoints
  - Document: Maintain API inventory in .jules/security/api-inventory.md
  
- API10:2023 Unsafe Consumption of APIs
  - Check: Validate third-party API responses, timeouts enforced
  - Test: Mock malicious third-party responses
  - Auto-fix: Add response validation, set 30s timeout for external calls

